        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Mark and a Seal</title>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #f7f7f5;\n      color: #080808;\n    }\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #fbfbfa;\n      font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Trebuchet MS\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .title {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 20px;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      font-size: 48px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .subtitle {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 104px;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #1f628c;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: .2px;\n    }\n    .lesson {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 146px;\n      left: 17px;\n      width: 510px;\n    }\n    .row {\n      position: relative;\n      height: 41px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .en {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      font-size: 15.7px;\n      line-height: 18px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: -.18px;\n    }\n    .cn {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 20px;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 16px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #222;\n    }\n    .red { color: #d42124; font-weight: 900; }\n    .small { font-size: 15.2px; }\n    .tiny { font-size: 14.8px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"title\">40 篇短文背完 3500 词</div>\n    <div class=\"subtitle\">一． Mark and a Seal 马克和海豹</div>\n\n    <div class=\"lesson\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\">①Mark <span class=\"red\">rented</span> an <b>accommodation</b> with his <span class=\"red\">pension</span> <span class=\"red\">near</span> the <span class=\"red\">shore</span>. He paid</div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">租借　　　　住处　　　　　养老金　在...旁边　海岸</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\"><span class=\"red\">annual visits</span> there to enjoy the <span class=\"red\">vivid beauty</span> in the <span class=\"red\">depths</span> of the <span class=\"red\">pure</span> sea.</div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">每年的访问　　　　享受　　生动的　美丽　　　　深处　　　纯粹的</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\">②<span class=\"red\">Once</span>, with his <span class=\"red\">underwater telescope</span> and <b>flashlight</b>, Mark <span class=\"red\">dived along</span> the</div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">有一次　　　　水下　　望远镜　　　　　手电筒　　　　　潜　沿着</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\"><b>boundary</b> <span class=\"red\">between</span> the <span class=\"red\">steep reef</span> and the <span class=\"red\">area</span> of <span class=\"red\">seaweed conservation</span>.</div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">分界线　　在...之间　　陡峭的暗礁　　　　地区　　　海草　　保护区</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\"><span class=\"red\">Suddenly</span> an <span class=\"red\">awesome</span> Antarctic <span class=\"red\">seal</span> with <span class=\"red\">sharp teeth</span> <span class=\"red\">appeared opposite</span></div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">突然　　　令人畏惧的　　南极的　　海豹　　　锋利的牙齿　　出现　　在...对面</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\">him. Every cell in his <span class=\"red\">body</span> was <b>scared</b> to death. <span class=\"red\">But</span> soon, he was <b>aware</b></div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">　　　　　　细胞　　　身体　　　被吓死了　　　　但是　　　　意识到</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\">that he wasn't the <b>target</b> of an <span class=\"red\">attack</span>. With a <b>neat wound</b> in its <span class=\"red\">lip</span> <b>caused</b></div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">　　　　　　　　目标　　　　袭击　　　　　整齐的伤口　　　嘴唇　　造成</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\">by <span class=\"red\">a shark</span>, this grey seal was <span class=\"red\">washed upside down</span> by the tides <span class=\"red\">time after</span></div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">　　　鲨鱼　　　灰色的海豹　　　被冲上　　　　　　潮水　　时不时地</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\"><span class=\"red\">time</span>. But it tried to jog Mark <span class=\"red\">as if</span> to <span class=\"red\">urge</span> him to <span class=\"red\">help</span> it. So Mark <b>abandoned</b></div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">时间　　　　　努力轻轻撞　　好像　　　　督促　　　　帮助　　　　　放弃</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\"><b>fleeing</b> away. With its <span class=\"red\">teamwork</span>, Mark used a <span class=\"red\">net</span> to drag the <span class=\"red\">seal</span> to the</div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">　逃跑　　　　　　团队合作　　　　　　　网　　　　拖　　　海豹</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\"><span class=\"red\">shallow water</span>. Without <b>pausing</b> he <span class=\"red\">helped it out</span> of a simple <span class=\"red\">situation</span></div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">　浅水区　　　　毫不　停歇地　　帮助它解决问题　　　　　　简单的手术</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\">and <span class=\"red\">settled</span> it in a <b>narrow cave</b> by the <span class=\"red\">seaside</span>. Every time he brought it <span class=\"red\">tasty</span></div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">　　　安顿　　　　　　狭窄的　山洞　　　　　海边　　　　　　　美味</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\">fish it would yell and suck his hands happily. <span class=\"red\">Witnesses</span> said their <span class=\"red\">anecdotes</span></div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">　　　　　叫喊　　　吮吸　　　　开心地　　　目击者　　　他们的轶事</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"en\">reflected a <span class=\"red\">magic</span> dimension of the relationship between <span class=\"red\">humans</span> and animals.</div>\n        <div class=\"cn\">映射　　　奇妙的　方面　　　　　　关系　　　　　　　人　与　动物</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
